---
layout: base/base.njk
title: "Home"
description: "Welcome to Templepatrick Presbyterian Church"
permalink: index.html
---
<div class="flex flex-col pt-[0px] md:pt-[40px]">
<div class="px-[0px] md:px-[40px]">
    <div class="relative h-[calc(100vh-80px)] overflow-hidden rounded-[0px] md:rounded-[20px]">
        {% image "src/assets/images/index-background-header.webp", "", "absolute inset-[0px] block h-full w-full object-cover", { sizes: "100vw", widths: [800, 1200, 1600, 2400] } %}
        <div class="absolute inset-[0px] bg-navy/70"></div>
        <div class="absolute inset-[0px] z-[1] flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-[40px] px-[20px] text-center text-white">
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-[8px]">
                <p class="[font-family:Poppins] text-[20px] font-normal md:text-[32px] not-italic leading-[100%] tracking-[0%] text-center">Welcome to</p>
                <h1 class="[font-family:Adonis] text-[28px] font-bold md:text-[56px] lg:text-[80px] not-italic leading-[100%] tracking-[0%] text-center uppercase">Templepatrick<br>Presbyterian</h1>
            </div>
            <p class="[font-family:Poppins] text-[16px] font-normal md:text-[24px] not-italic leading-[100%] tracking-[0%] text-center">“To know God; and to make God better known”</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<section class="px-[10px] md:px-[40px] py-[100px] text-navy">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-[30px]">
            <h2 class="heading-2-bold">A Sunday with Us</h2>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-[40px]">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-[40px] lg:grid-cols-3">
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-[12px] rounded-[12px]">
                        <h3 class="heading-5-bold">Morning Service</h3>
                        <p class="text-[16px] font-normal leading-[24px] text-gray">Every Sunday at 11am, with Bible Class for Year 8-12, Creche for children up to age 3 and Sunday school for everyone in-between.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-[12px] rounded-[12px]">
                        <h3 class="heading-5-bold">Evening Service</h3>
                        <p class="text-[16px] font-normal leading-[24px] text-gray">On the first Sunday of every month in the Church Building at 7.00pm, covering topics similar to that of the morning service in a deeper way.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-[12px] rounded-[12px]">
                        <h3 class="heading-5-bold">Praise Night</h3>
                        <p class="text-[16px] font-normal leading-[24px] text-gray">An evening of praise, fellowship and discussion on the third Sunday of every month in the Main Hall, with tea and coffee from 6.30pm.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p class="w-full text-[16px] font-normal leading-[24px] text-gray">Before our Morning service we offer a time of Prayer in the Crèche from 10.15am to 10.30am, along with fellowship over tea and coffee after the service. For those who cannot make it, we also live-stream our Morning Service and Evening Service. You can catch-up on YouTube <a href="{{ site.social.youtube }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline">HERE</a>.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<section class="px-[10px] md:px-[40px]">
    <div class="rounded-[40px] bg-[#04182B] px-[40px] text-mint-white py-[100px]">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-[30px]">
                <h2 class="heading-2-bold">About Us</h2>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-[20px]">
                    <p class="w-full text-[16px] font-normal leading-[24px]">We are a family of people seeking to grow in our relationship with God, discover more of His grace for living and encourage others to explore what it means to be a follower of Jesus Christ.</p>
                    <p class="w-full text-[16px] font-normal leading-[24px]">Sunday services are an opportunity to meet together as a community to worship God. Our emphasis is on seeing God's Word applied to daily living. Events and organisations throughout the week complement this. We trust you will find a home with us and a space to nurture your faith.</p>
                    <p class="w-full text-[16px] font-normal leading-[24px]">May you know God's richest blessing. Richard Kerr</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<section class="px-[10px] md:px-[40px] py-[100px] text-navy">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-[30px]">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <h2 class="[font-family:Adonis] text-[40px] font-bold not-italic leading-[93%] tracking-[0%] text-center">Follow Us</h2>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-[20px]">
                    <a href="{{ site.social.facebook }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Facebook">
                        <img src="/assets/svgs/facebook-navy.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24">
                    </a>
                    <a href="{{ site.social.instagram }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Instagram">
                        <img src="/assets/svgs/instagram-navy.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24">
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-[40px] md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
                {%- for n in [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6] %}
                <a href="{{ site.social.instagram }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="block aspect-square overflow-hidden">
                    {% image "src/assets/images/events/instagram/instagram-" + n + ".webp", "Instagram post " + n, "block h-full w-full object-cover", { sizes: "33vw", widths: [400, 800] } %}
                </a>
                {%- endfor %}
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
</div>
